   "title": "So three months ago, I made",
   "summary": "So three months ago, I made a huge mistake with my editing workflow. I spent six hours on a single short, and it got 40 views. Um 40. That is the moment I decided to completely fix my process.",
   "energy": 0.87,
   "emotion": "neutral",
   "importance": 0.2
  },
  {
   "start": 14.14,
   "end": 27.12,
   "title": "The first thing that changed everything",
   "summary": "The first thing that changed everything is that I stopped starting my videos with an intro. No more hey guys, welcome back. I just start mid-sentence with the most interesting part. It sounds simple, but it more than dou",
   "energy": 0.76,
   "emotion": "neutral",
   "importance": 0.19
  },
  {
   "start": 28.77,
   "end": 40.89,
   "title": "The second thing is captions. If",
   "summary": "The second thing is captions. If a viewer cannot read your screen, they cannot follow you. Big text, two or three words at a time, and highlight the important words. People watch with a sound off all the time.",
   "energy": 0.76,
   "emotion": "neutral",
   "importance": 0.14
  },
  {
